[meta]
lang: en
title: OireMark conformance tests: Paragraphs and Line Breaks
[/meta]

h1. Paragraphs and Line Breaks

Tests for Section 4 of the specification.

h2. Line Breaks

h3. Single line {#paragraphs-single-line}
[code om]
Just one line.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Just one line.</p>
[/code]

h3. Single newline is a line break {#paragraphs-line-break}
[code om]
This is line one.
This is line two, same paragraph, with a line break before it.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>This is line one.<br>
This is line two, same paragraph, with a line break before it.</p>
[/code]

h3. Several line breaks in one paragraph {#paragraphs-several-breaks}
[code om]
Roses are red,
Violets are blue,
OireMark is strict
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Roses are red,<br>
Violets are blue,<br>
OireMark is strict</p>
[/code]

h3. Markers do not pair across a line break {#paragraphs-break-no-pairing}
[code om]
*bold
text*
[/code]
[code html]
<p>*bold<br>
text*</p>
[/code]

h3. Inline formatting on both sides of a line break {#paragraphs-break-formatting}
[code om]
*Bold* line
_italic_ line
[/code]
[code html]
<p><strong>Bold</strong> line<br>
<em>italic</em> line</p>
[/code]

h2. Paragraphs

h3. Blank line starts a new paragraph {#paragraphs-blank-line}
[code om]
This is line one.
This is line two, same paragraph, with a line break before it.

This is a new paragraph.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>This is line one.<br>
This is line two, same paragraph, with a line break before it.</p>
<p>This is a new paragraph.</p>
[/code]

h3. Several blank lines collapse into one paragraph break {#paragraphs-collapse}
[code om]
First.



Second.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>First.</p>
<p>Second.</p>
[/code]

h3. Three paragraphs {#paragraphs-three}
[code om]
One.

Two.

Three.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>One.</p>
<p>Two.</p>
<p>Three.</p>
[/code]

h3. Leading blank lines produce nothing {#paragraphs-leading-blank}
[code om]


Text.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Text.</p>
[/code]

h3. Trailing newlines and blank lines are ignored {#paragraphs-trailing-blank}
[code hex]
54 65 78 74 2E 0A 0A 0A
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Text.</p>
[/code]

h2. Block Elements End a Paragraph

h3. A list item ends a paragraph {#paragraphs-end-list}
[code om]
Shopping list:
* Milk
* Eggs
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Shopping list:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Milk</li>
  <li>Eggs</li>
</ul>
[/code]

h3. A numbered list item ends a paragraph {#paragraphs-end-numbered}
[code om]
I just finished reading
1984. Orwell at his best.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>I just finished reading</p>
<ol start="1984">
  <li>Orwell at his best.</li>
</ol>
[/code]

h3. A heading ends a paragraph {#paragraphs-end-heading}
[code om]
Intro text
h2. Heading
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Intro text</p>
<h2 id="heading">Heading</h2>
[/code]

h3. A block tag ends a paragraph {#paragraphs-end-block-tag}
[code om]
Before
[note]
Inside
[/note]
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Before</p>
<div role="note" class="note">
  <p>Inside</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. A short form quote ends a paragraph {#paragraphs-end-quote}
[code om]
Before
> Quoted
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Before</p>
<blockquote>
  <p>Quoted</p>
</blockquote>
[/code]

h3. A horizontal rule ends a paragraph {#paragraphs-end-rule}
[code om]
Before
---
After
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Before</p>
<hr>
<p>After</p>
[/code]

h3. A table row ends a paragraph {#paragraphs-end-table}
[code om]
Before
| a | b |
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Before</p>
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. A definition term ends a paragraph {#paragraphs-end-definition}
[code om]
Before
; Term
: Definition
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Before</p>
<dl>
  <dt>Term</dt>
  <dd>Definition</dd>
</dl>
[/code]

h3. A code fence ends a paragraph {#paragraphs-end-fence}
````om
Before
```
code
```
````
[code html]
<p>Before</p>
<pre><code>code
</code></pre>
[/code]

h3. Text that only resembles a list marker continues the paragraph {#paragraphs-not-list}
[code om]
Text
*not a list
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Text<br>
*not a list</p>
[/code]

h3. Text that only resembles a quote continues the paragraph {#paragraphs-not-quote}
[code om]
Text
>not a quote
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Text<br>
&gt;not a quote</p>
[/code]

h3. Text that only resembles a heading continues the paragraph {#paragraphs-not-heading}
[code om]
Text
h2.Title
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Text<br>
h2.Title</p>
[/code]

h2. Profiles

h3. Paragraphs are allowed in the basic profile {#paragraphs-profile-basic}
; profile
: basic
[code om]
One.
Still one.

Two.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>One.<br>
Still one.</p>
<p>Two.</p>
[/code]

h3. Inline profile output is not wrapped in a paragraph {#paragraphs-profile-inline}
; profile
: inline
[code om]
*Hello*, world
[/code]
[code html]
<strong>Hello</strong>, world
[/code]

h3. A newline is an error in the inline profile {#paragraphs-profile-inline-newline}
; profile
: inline
[code om]
First line
Second line
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 2
[/code]

h3. A blank line is an error in the inline profile {#paragraphs-profile-inline-blank}
; profile
: inline
[code om]
First

Second
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 2
[/code]
